      "call": "GET registered query for fiscal_year=2017 through 2021",
      "result": "Fetched exact USAspending agency 097 awards obligations: FY2017 327990949917.96 USD = 327.991B, FY2018 365937501255.11 USD = 365.938B, FY2019 391333992872.89 USD = 391.334B, FY2020 431883672152.30 USD = 431.884B, FY2021 395332709399.53 USD = 395.333B. FY2016 returned 304733246938.93 USD but USAspending message said account data before FY2017 Q2 were not available under the DATA Act, so I excluded FY2016 from the comparable base rate."
