      "call": "GET registered query for fiscal_year=2022 through 2026",
      "result": "Fetched exact USAspending agency 097 awards obligations: FY2022 424512414112.80 USD = 424.512B, FY2023 467273435599.16 USD = 467.273B, FY2024 456945504400.91 USD = 456.946B, FY2025 501543513238.03 USD = 501.544B. FY2026 current incomplete check returned obligations 298980123138.95 USD = 298.980B through latest_action_date 2026-08-11 with transaction_count 2641896, so I do not treat it as a full-year comparable print."
